The indicator first checks the price's position relative to the channel:
if the price
is ABOVE
the upper band — we check the BUY conditions
if the price
is BELOW
the lower band — we check the SELL conditions
if the price
is INSIDE
the channel — there are NO signals
It makes sense: a channel breakout is an excellent initial filter.
